COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.id IS '报表记录自增身份';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.category IS '由文件名前缀解析的报表分类';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.name IS '报表文件名，发布幂等唯一键';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.ts IS '文件名解析的时间标签，保留原字符串';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.columns_json IS '按原CSV顺序保存的列名JSON数组';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.rows_json IS '按原CSV顺序保存并补齐列宽的数据行JSON数组';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.size_bytes IS '源CSV文件字节数';
COMMENT ON COLUMN eval_report.created_at IS '首次成功发布的数据库时间'
